<title>CHINA: China rice exports up 256 pct in Jan-May.</title>
<headline>China rice exports up 256 pct in Jan-May.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China exported 270,000 tonnes of rice in the first five months of 1997, up by 256.1 percent compared with the same period last year, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	 EXPORTS JAN-MAY	MAY	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Rice	270,000	  110,000	+256.1</p>
<p>	 IMPORTS JAN-MAY	MAY</p>
<p>		130,000	  20,000	- 59.4</p>
<p>Note: Figures given in tonnes</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
